Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team regarding your lounge experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} airport.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We always want our customers to have a relaxing and enjoyable experience in our lounges, so I'm sorry to hear you were dissatisfied with the<em><strong> food/beverages</strong></em> served.<br />
<br />
We place a high priority on both the quality and selection of the food and beverage products we serve onboard, and our Food and Beverage team work hard to choose options that everyone can enjoy.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team which will be used to improve our inflight experience in the future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience&nbsp;— we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
